=== WHAT WAS BUILT (parity with the web source, read end-to-end) ===
  SignalQueryControls is the shared signal-query control set for the Signal Log Viewer /
  Signal Explorer pages. The web module exports a BE→FE adapter + helpers + four controls;
  the native surface reproduces its data, composition, every state, and i18n keys, binding
  through P1/S8 state-holder seams (no view I/O), tokens via P1/S9, copy via P1/S10, and a
  P1/S11 `view.opened` event.

  Adapter (verbatim port of components/__tests__/SignalQueryControls.adapter.test.ts):
    adaptSignalHistoryPoint — Double/Int64→value_num, Bool(incl. false)→value_bool,
      String/Enum/Time→value_str, NaN/±Inf→nil, null→all-nil, ts passed through verbatim.
    adaptSignalHistoryResp — [] for nil envelope / missing data; envelope `signal` stamped
      onto every row; full Phase-42 typed shape → table-renderable rows.
  Helpers: getValueType, formatValue (JS String(number) parity: 42 not 42.0), formatTimestampMs
    (YYYY-MM-DD HH:mm:ss.SSS or "—"), toLocalDatetimeStr, TYPE_BADGE_COLOR / TYPE_VALUE_COLOR
    (num→cyan, str→emerald/green, bool→amber, null→muted), PAGE_SIZES [25,50,100],
    TIME_RANGE_PRESETS [1h,6h,24h,7d,30d] + matchTimeRangePreset (±60s tolerance).
  Controls (web → native):
    SignalMultiSelect    — selected chips (removable) + search field + filtered dropdown
                           (cap 50 + "+N more — refine search"); loading/error/empty leaf states.
    DateTimeRangeControls— From / To native DatePickers + Quick-Range preset chips (active
                           highlight via matchTimeRangePreset; aria "{{label}} time range").
    QueryControls        — Rows menu Picker over PAGE_SIZES + "Query" action (play glyph /
                           spinner; disabled computed, never literal).
    SignalDataTable      — #/Timestamp/Signal/Value(type-tinted)/Type(badge) grid + loading
                           skeleton + "No results" empty + server pager (records, first/prev/
                           next/last, page-of indicator).

  States rendered (every one, no hidden surface): loading / empty / error / stale / offline.
  i18n keys from the web source (table "SignalQueryControls"), all present + tested:
    signalQuery.from="From"  signalQuery.to="To"  signalQuery.quickRange="Quick Range"
    signalQuery.preset.aria="{{label}} time range"  signalQuery.query="Query"  signalQuery.rows="Rows"
  Hooks (useQuery available-signals + useTranslation) bound via the SignalQueryControlsSource
  P1/S8 seam; no HTTP in the view. Telemetry: `view.opened` emitted once, slug "SignalQueryControls".

